Package: scf
Title: Tools for Analyzing the Survey of Consumer Finances
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Joseph","Cohen", role = c("aut","cre"),
             email = "joseph.cohen@qc.cuny.edu",
             comment = c(affiliation = "Department of Sociology, CUNY Queens College")))
Description: Tools for working with the Survey of Consumer Finances (SCF) micro‑data.
  Functions download prepared '.rds' files, construct replicate‑weighted
  multiply‑imputed survey designs, compute descriptive statistics and model
  estimates, and produce plots and tables.
